IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 2, ARTICLES 8 TO 19.
-- Layer 1. Each article substitutes (or restates as unchanged) figures in an instrument that is not among the
-- inputs. The Order states both the figure it replaces and the figure it puts in its place, so both are values
-- (`a sum and its replacement`); the figures were read from the text file by script (%%SUM), not typed.
-- The dates these take effect are art 1(3) (uro-part1-intro): none of arts 8 to 19 is dated by article 7.

§ `Articles 8 to 10 -- Statutory Sick Pay, Statutory Maternity Pay and the other statutory payments`

-- src:125 | 8 Statutory Sick Pay
-- src:126 | In section 157(1) of the Contributions and Benefits Act (rate of payment of statutory sick pay) for “£118.75” substitute “£123.25”.
@ref art 8 (src:125-126)
`art 8: section 157(1) of the Contributions and Benefits Act, the weekly rate of statutory sick pay` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 118.75, 123.25


-- src:127 | 9 Statutory Maternity Pay
