@ref art 10(1)(b) (src:132)
`art 10(1)(b): regulation 3(a) of the Statutory Paternity Pay and Statutory Adoption Pay (Weekly Rates) Regulations 2002, the weekly rate of statutory adoption pay` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 187.18, 194.32

