@ref art 10(2) (src:133)
`art 10(2): regulation 40(1)(a) of the Statutory Shared Parental Pay (General) Regulations 2014, the weekly rate of statutory shared parental pay` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 187.18, 194.32

