@ref art 10(3) (src:134)
`art 10(3): regulation 20(1)(a) of the Statutory Parental Bereavement Pay (General) Regulations 2020, the weekly rate of statutory parental bereavement pay` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 187.18, 194.32

