DECLARE `a paragraph of regulation 4 of the Disability Living Allowance Regulations 1991` IS ONE OF
    `DLA regulation 4(1)(a)`
    `DLA regulation 4(1)(b)`
    `DLA regulation 4(1)(c)`
    `DLA regulation 4(2)(a)`
