@ref art 14 (src:147-153)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a paragraph of regulation 4 of the Disability Living Allowance Regulations 1991`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 14: the replaced and the replacing weekly rate` `which one` MEANS
