    WHEN `DLA regulation 4(1)(b)` THEN `art 14(b): regulation 4(1)(b) of the Social Security (Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 1991`
    WHEN `DLA regulation 4(1)(c)` THEN `art 14(c): regulation 4(1)(c) of the Social Security (Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 1991`
    WHEN `DLA regulation 4(2)(a)` THEN `art 14(d): regulation 4(2)(a) of the Social Security (Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 1991`
    WHEN `DLA regulation 4(2)(b)` THEN `art 14(e): regulation 4(2)(b) of the Social Security (Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 1991`


