§ `Article 18 -- Rates of bereavement benefits`

-- src:171 | 18 Rates of bereavement benefits
-- src:172 | In the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010—
-- src:173 | (a) in regulation 2 (rate of widowed mother’s allowance and widow’s pension) for “£150.90” substitute “£156.65”; and
@ref art 18(a) (src:171-173)
`art 18(a): regulation 2 of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010, the rate of widowed mother's allowance and widow's pension` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 150.90, 156.65

-- src:174 | (b) in regulation 3 (rate of widowed parent’s allowance) for “£150.90” substitute “£156.65”.
@ref art 18(b) (src:174)
`art 18(b): regulation 3 of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010, the rate of widowed parent's allowance` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 150.90, 156.65

@ref art 18 (src:171-174)
DECLARE `a regulation of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010` IS ONE OF
    `widow's pension and widowed mother's allowance (regulation 2 of the Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010)`
    `widowed parent's allowance (regulation 3 of the Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010)`

@ref art 18 (src:171-174)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a regulation of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 18: the replaced and the replacing weekly rate` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `widow's pension and widowed mother's allowance (regulation 2 of the Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010)` THEN `art 18(a): regulation 2 of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010, the rate of widowed mother's allowance and widow's pension`
    WHEN `widowed parent's allowance (regulation 3 of the Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010)` THEN `art 18(b): regulation 3 of the Rate of Bereavement Benefits Regulations 2010, the rate of widowed parent's allowance`


§ `Article 19 -- Rates of bereavement support payment`

-- Each of the four sums "remains unchanged": the pair carries the same figure twice (fork F-08).
-- src:175 | 19 Rates of bereavement support payment
-- src:176 | In regulation 3 of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017 (rate of bereavement support payment)—
-- src:177 | (a) in paragraph (1) “£350” remains unchanged;
@ref art 19(a) (src:175-177)
`art 19(a): regulation 3(1) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 350, 350

-- src:178 | (b) in paragraph (2) “£3,500” remains unchanged;
@ref art 19(b) (src:178)
`art 19(b): regulation 3(2) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 3500, 3500

-- src:179 | (c) in paragraph (4) “£100” remains unchanged; and
@ref art 19(c) (src:179)
`art 19(c): regulation 3(4) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 100, 100

-- src:180 | (d) in paragraph (5) “£2,500” remains unchanged.
@ref art 19(d) (src:180)
`art 19(d): regulation 3(5) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 2500, 2500

@ref art 19 (src:175-180)
DECLARE `a paragraph of regulation 3 of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017` IS ONE OF
    `BSP regulation 3(1)`
    `BSP regulation 3(2)`
    `BSP regulation 3(4)`
    `BSP regulation 3(5)`

@ref art 19 (src:175-180)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a paragraph of regulation 3 of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 19: the sum, replaced or restated as unchanged` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `BSP regulation 3(1)` THEN `art 19(a): regulation 3(1) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017`
    WHEN `BSP regulation 3(2)` THEN `art 19(b): regulation 3(2) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017`
    WHEN `BSP regulation 3(4)` THEN `art 19(c): regulation 3(4) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017`
    WHEN `BSP regulation 3(5)` THEN `art 19(d): regulation 3(5) of the Bereavement Support Payment Regulations 2017`

